  "stages": [
    {
      "name": "Elements",
      "opening": [
        "In this world",
        "Everyone must speak Japanese to stay alive.",
        "I can't speak a word of it.",
        "Mr. Kotoba turns those who fail into his inspectors.",
        "But when they reach my house, they walk straight past.",
        "A clerk forgot to put my name on the list.",
        "At the water gate, I find a pen and a note that might keep me alive."
      ],
      "encounters": [
        {"id":"s1-01","name":"Ember","element":"FIRE","attacks":["FIRE"],"health":30,"damage":6,"lessonId":"水"},
        {"id":"s1-02","name":"Iron","element":"METAL","attacks":["METAL"],"health":32,"damage":6,"lessonId":"火"},
        {"id":"s1-03","name":"Thorn","element":"WOOD","attacks":["WOOD"],"health":34,"damage":6,"lessonId":"金"},
        {"id":"s1-04","name":"Clay","element":"EARTH","attacks":["EARTH"],"health":36,"damage":7,"lessonId":"木"},
        {"id":"s1-05","name":"Mist","element":"WATER","attacks":["WATER"],"health":38,"damage":7,"lessonId":"土"},
        {"id":"s1-06","name":"Ember II","element":"FIRE","attacks":["FIRE","WOOD"],"health":42,"damage":7,"lessonId":"水"},
        {"id":"s1-07","name":"Iron II","element":"METAL","attacks":["METAL","WATER"],"health":44,"damage":7,"lessonId":"火"},
        {"id":"s1-08","name":"Thorn II","element":"WOOD","attacks":["WOOD","FIRE"],"health":46,"damage":8,"lessonId":"金"},
        {"id":"s1-09","name":"Clay II","element":"EARTH","attacks":["EARTH","METAL"],"health":48,"damage":8,"lessonId":"木"},
        {"id":"s1-10","name":"Gate Inspector","element":"WATER","attacks":["WATER","EARTH","FIRE"],"health":64,"damage":8,"lessonId":"土"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pets",
      "opening": [
        "In this district, the pets still wait for their owners.",
        "Every house I pass has an inspection seal on its door.",
        "The inspectors wear numbers from Kotoba's punishment list.",
        "Beside one sealed door, a dog waits by its owner's bowl.",
        "It barks at an inspector passing through the street.",
        "He stops halfway through reading his orders.",
        "I follow him to find out who the dog recognizes."
      ],
      "encounters": [
        {"id":"s2-01","name":"Ember Hound","element":"FIRE","attacks":["FIRE","EARTH"],"health":40,"damage":7,"lessonId":"犬"},
        {"id":"s2-02","name":"Moss Cat","element":"WOOD","attacks":["WOOD","WATER"],"health":42,"damage":7,"lessonId":"猫"},
        {"id":"s2-03","name":"Iron Bird","element":"METAL","attacks":["METAL","FIRE"],"health":42,"damage":7,"lessonId":"鳥"},
        {"id":"s2-04","name":"Mist Fish","element":"WATER","attacks":["WATER","WOOD"],"health":44,"damage":8,"lessonId":"魚"},
        {"id":"s2-05","name":"Clay Horse","element":"EARTH","attacks":["EARTH","METAL"],"health":44,"damage":8,"lessonId":"馬"},
        {"id":"s2-06","name":"Hound Sentinel","element":"FIRE","attacks":["WOOD","FIRE"],"health":46,"damage":8,"lessonId":"犬"},
        {"id":"s2-07","name":"Cat Sentinel","element":"WOOD","attacks":["FIRE","WOOD"],"health":46,"damage":8,"lessonId":"猫"},
        {"id":"s2-08","name":"Bird Sentinel","element":"METAL","attacks":["WATER","METAL"],"health":48,"damage":8,"lessonId":"鳥"},
        {"id":"s2-09","name":"Fish Sentinel","element":"WATER","attacks":["EARTH","WATER"],"health":50,"damage":8,"lessonId":"魚"},
        {"id":"s2-10","name":"Stable Inspector","element":"EARTH","attacks":["METAL","EARTH","WOOD"],"health":70,"damage":9,"lessonId":"馬"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Weather",
      "opening": [
        "On this road, everyone needs permission to escape the storm.",
        "People shiver in a queue that stretches uphill.",
        "Rain washes the ink from their inspection papers.",
        "The order to stay in line is printed on tin.",
        "An empty shelter stands beside them with its door locked.",
        "Its keeper was once a person who needed shelter too.",
        "I walk toward him, hoping he can still choose to turn the key."
      ],
      "encounters": [
        {"id":"s3-01","name":"Rain Wisp","element":"WATER","attacks":["WATER","METAL"],"health":42,"damage":8,"lessonId":"雨"},
        {"id":"s3-02","name":"Gale Wisp","element":"WOOD","attacks":["WOOD","EARTH"],"health":44,"damage":8,"lessonId":"風"},
        {"id":"s3-03","name":"Snow Wisp","element":"METAL","attacks":["METAL","WATER"],"health":44,"damage":8,"lessonId":"雪"},
        {"id":"s3-04","name":"Cloud Wisp","element":"EARTH","attacks":["EARTH","FIRE"],"health":46,"damage":8,"lessonId":"雲"},
        {"id":"s3-05","name":"Dusk Wisp","element":"FIRE","attacks":["FIRE","WOOD"],"health":46,"damage":8,"lessonId":"空"},
        {"id":"s3-06","name":"Rain Sentinel","element":"WATER","attacks":["FIRE","WATER"],"health":48,"damage":8,"lessonId":"雨"},
        {"id":"s3-07","name":"Gale Sentinel","element":"WOOD","attacks":["METAL","WOOD"],"health":48,"damage":9,"lessonId":"風"},
        {"id":"s3-08","name":"Snow Sentinel","element":"METAL","attacks":["EARTH","METAL"],"health":50,"damage":9,"lessonId":"雪"},
        {"id":"s3-09","name":"Cloud Sentinel","element":"EARTH","attacks":["WOOD","WATER","EARTH"],"health":50,"damage":9,"lessonId":"雲"},
