  "ending": [
    "Kotoba turns the last page to find that I have passed his own exam.",
    "His final seal breaks, and he falls beside the open ledger.",
    "Beyond the unlocked gates, people gather to read the orders that kept them apart.",
    "They replace the inspection notices with a sign for a free class.",
    "When a student asks how to write 水, I show them and pass over my pen.",
    "I wait while they try again."
  ]
